                     <origDate when-custom="130X/131X" notBefore="1300" notAfter="1319" calendar="#gregorian">s. xiv in.</origDate>
                  </origin>
                  <provenance type="#e"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_201">Exeter, Devon.
                        Hospital of St John the Baptist and St John the Evangelist</orgName><p>'Liber Hospitalis S. J. Exon' (fol. iiv). Also: 'Istum librum
                        dat et concedit magister Johannes Westcote Canonicus Ecclesiae Cathedralis
                        Exon' custos Hospitalis Sancti Johannis Baptiste infram portam orientalem
                        Ciuitatis Exon' Magistro et Fratribus eiusdem hospit' in plenam et perpetuam
                        elemosinam et eorum successoribus imperpetuum et eisdem liberauit
                        possessionem dum tamen eorum consensu et assensu habeat Vusum eiusdem ad
                        terminum vite sue Dat' Exon' xiiii die mensis Februarii Anno domini
                        Millesimo CCCmo xviimo.'. However, see note below.</p></provenance>
